{"id":"2274525186","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:97c827fd-41ee-460c-8f51-353e72947a5e:page/2274525186","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6OTdjODI3ZmQtNDFlZS00NjBjLThmNTEtMzUzZTcyOTQ3YTVlOmNvbnRlbnQvMjI3NDUyNTE4Ng==","status":"current","title":"Equipment File Management API Documentation","version":{"by":{"type":"known","accountId":"557058:9ff47bd5-d139-4f2c-8d06-5d42bb7f276d","accountType":"atlassian","email":"","publicName":"Jaco Möhlmann","profilePicture":{"path":"/wiki/aa-avatar/557058:9ff47bd5-d139-4f2c-8d06-5d42bb7f276d","width":48,"height":48,"isDefault":false},"displayName":"Jaco Möhlmann","isExternalCollaborator":false,"isGuest":false,"locale":"nl","accountStatus":"active","_expandable":{"operations":"","personalSpace":""},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/user?accountId=557058:9ff47bd5-d139-4f2c-8d06-5d42bb7f276d"}},"when":"2025-08-12T06:58:26.452Z","friendlyWhen":"Aug 12, 2025","message":"","number":1,"minorEdit":false,"ncsStepVersion":"1","ncsStepVersionSource":"ncs-ack","confRev":"confluence$content$2274525186.50","contentTypeModified":false,"_expandable":{"collaborators":"","content":"/rest/api/content/2274525186"},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2274525186/version/1"}},"macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"storage":{"value":"<p>This page documents the file management endpoints for the Equipment&nbsp;API. These endpoints allow you to retrieve file information and download files associated with equipment items.</p><h2>API Base&nbsp;URL</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9366e10b-48c5-4c50-a84b-612c95057cf5\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[API/v1/{grid.id}/equipment/{id}/fileoverview]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3>Endpoints</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"2cf3e59e-b65b-4cfd-b5cc-e18713965119\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[GET API/v1/{grid.id}/equipment/{id}/fileoverview\nGET API/v1/{grid.id}/equipment/{id}/fileoverview/download]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>Where:</p><ul><li><p><code>{grid.id}</code>&nbsp;is your grid identifier&nbsp;(e.g., grid.1016.6)</p></li><li><p><code>{id}</code>&nbsp;is the&nbsp;equipment ID</p></li></ul><h2>Authentication</h2><p>All endpoints require authentication&nbsp;with an API key that has the&nbsp;<code>EXTERNALINVENTORYMANAGEMENT</code>&nbsp;role.</p><h2>Endpoints</h2><h3>1. List Files</h3><h4>Request</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d87a24eb-d341-45b0-9296-27793e4262f0\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[GET API/v1/{grid.id}/equipment/{id}/fileoverview]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Description</h4><p>Retrieves a hierarchical&nbsp;list of all files associated with the specified equipment item.</p><h4>Path Parameters</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"0e48f2a8-b6cc-4615-9643-75c85b0d135b\"><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Parameter </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Type </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description </strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>grid.id  &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>string </p></td><td><p>Your grid identifier&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>id&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>integer </p></td><td><p>Equipment ID to retrieve files for&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4>Response</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"8b1520be-8515-4dca-a365-85aa1efcdf4e\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[[\n  {\n    \"File_id\": 123,\n    \"Name\": \"Equipment Manual.pdf\",\n    \"Items\": [\n      {\n        \"File_id\": 456,\n        \"Name\": \"Chapter 1.pdf\",\n        \"Items\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"File_id\": 789,\n        \"Name\": \"Chapter 2.pdf\",\n        \"Items\": []\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"File_id\": 234,\n    \"Name\": \"Maintenance Records.xlsx\",\n    \"Items\": []\n  }\n]]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Response&nbsp;Fields</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"14e0a888-fca2-4b50-b1f8-123dd4a65c27\"><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Field</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Type</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>File_id&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>integer </p></td><td><p>Unique identifier for the file&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Name&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>string </p></td><td><p>Name&nbsp;of the file </p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Items&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>array </p></td><td><p>List of child files/folders&nbsp;(recursive structure)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p /><h4>Status Codes</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"718606d5-6b83-455a-8f19-b731c8fc8895\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 148.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 610.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Code</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>200</p></td><td><p>OK. Everything worked as expected.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>400</p></td><td><p>Bad Request. The request was unacceptable, often due to missing a required parameter.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>401</p></td><td><p>Unauthorized. No valid API key provided.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>403</p></td><td><p>Forbidden. The API key doesn't have permissions to perform the request.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>404</p></td><td><p>Not Found. The requested resource doesn't exist.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>429</p></td><td><p>Too Many Requests. Too many requests hit the API too quickly. We recommend an exponential backoff of your requests.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>500, 502, 503, 504</p></td><td><p>Server Errors. Something went wrong on MFP end.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>2. Download Files</h3><h4>Request</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"1bdbc1dd-c0a5-486f-b1b3-0d0c0e6882cd\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[POST API/v1/{grid.id}/equipment/{id}/fileoverview/download?file_ids=123&file_ids=456]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Description</h4><p>Downloads one or more files associated with the specified equipment as a ZIP archive.</p><h4>Path Parameters</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"70a2bb98-1a15-436a-8494-262ba49d5717\"><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Parameter </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Type </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description </strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>grid.id &nbsp;</p></td><td><p>string </p></td><td><p>Your grid identifier&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>id&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>integer </p></td><td><p>Equipment ID&nbsp;to download files for </p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4>Query Parameters</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"4dd110ca-1c16-4a18-9683-5b2aecaa723f\"><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Parameter </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Type </strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description </strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>file_ids&nbsp;</p></td><td><p>integer[]</p></td><td><p>Array of file IDs to include in the download. If&nbsp;not specified, all files will be included.&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4>Response</h4><p>A binary file stream containing a&nbsp;ZIP archive with the requested files.</p><p>The filename format will be:&nbsp;<code>{Barcode}_{EquipmentName}_{CurrentDate}.zip</code></p><h4>Special Features</h4><p>The ZIP archive handles:</p><ul><li><p>International&nbsp;characters in filenames</p></li><li><p>Duplicate filenames&nbsp;(by appending a counter)</p></li><li><p>Removal of invalid characters from filenames</p></li></ul><h4>Status&nbsp;Codes</h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"a17f32e2-1b68-4ef0-85be-b2f0b52e7dda\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 148.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 610.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Code</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>200</p></td><td><p>OK. Returns ZIP file .</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>400</p></td><td><p>Bad Request. The request was unacceptable, often due to missing a required parameter.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>401</p></td><td><p>Unauthorized. No valid API key provided.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>403</p></td><td><p>Forbidden. The API key doesn't have permissions to perform the request.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>404</p></td><td><p>Not Found. The requested resource doesn't exist.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>429</p></td><td><p>Too Many Requests. Too many requests hit the API too quickly. We recommend an exponential backoff of your requests.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>500, 502, 503, 504</p></td><td><p>Server Errors. Something went wrong on MFP end.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Example Usage</h2><h3>List&nbsp;Files Example</h3><h4>Request</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"a150d38d-7c3a-4379-95e7-6cb248d0db4b\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[GET API/v1/grid.1016.6/equipment/60/fileoverview]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Response</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c8f7d2dc-0ab8-4c7b-a401-710e3cc586b7\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[[\n  {\n    \"File_id\": 1001,\n    \"Name\": \"Calibration Certificate.pdf\",\n    \"Items\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"File_id\": 1002,\n    \"Name\": \"User Manuals\",\n    \"Items\": [\n      {\n        \"File_id\": 1003,\n        \"Name\": \"Operation Manual.pdf\",\n        \"Items\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"File_id\": 1004,\n        \"Name\": \"Maintenance Guide.pdf\",\n        \"Items\": []\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3>Download Files Example</h3><h4>Request</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c3513782-0218-4907-8e41-eaad77851b86\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[GET API/v1/grid.1016.6/equipment/60/fileoverview/download?file_ids=1001&file_ids=1003]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Response</h4><p>Binary file stream containing a ZIP archive named&nbsp;<code>Barcode_EquipmentName_20230615.zip</code>&nbsp;with the two requested files.</p><h2>Notes</h2><ul><li><p>File operations may be subject to user permissions&nbsp;within the system</p></li><li><p>Large ZIP files may take longer to generate</p></li><li><p>The API uses streaming&nbsp;to efficiently handle large files</p></li></ul>","representation":"storage","embeddedContent":[],"_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/2274525186"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":452},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/API","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/2274525186/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/2274525186/history","descendants":"/rest/api/content/2274525186/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/API","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/2274525186/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=2274525186","webui":"/spaces/API/pages/2274525186/Equipment+File+Management+API+Documentation","edituiv2":"/spaces/API/pages/edit-v2/2274525186","context":"/wiki","self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2274525186","tinyui":"/x/AoCShw","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki"}}